    "title": "Crews respond to house fire in Edmond - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Caroline Kelley ,\n15 hours ago\nEDMOND, Okla. ( KFOR ) - Crews responded to a house fire in Edmond Wednesday morning.\nOfficials say crews responded to a neighborhood near E 2nd St. and N Coltrane Rd. just before 7 a.m. Firefighters were able to knock the fire down quickly.\nThere is also a reported water main break in that area.\nIt is unclear how the fire started or if anyone was injured.\nNo more information is available at this time.\nCopyright 2026 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed.\nFor the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to KFOR.com Oklahoma City.",
